{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act54side_level_act54side_08_end","storyGroup":"act54side","storySort":12,"storyDependence":"act54side_level_act54side_08_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"SR-8","storyName":"月满","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"结城理等人打败了强大的怪物，吉阿达向裘里奥敞开心扉，诉说了自己对于“仪式”真正的寄托，也承认了裘里奥的怀念与痛苦。在与结城理和吉阿达的对话中，裘里奥放下了死志，异变也终于消散……","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act54side/level_act54side_08_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act54side_08","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":10,"next":12,"characters":["裘里奥","结城理","埃癸斯","吉阿达","山岸风花","岳羽由加莉","天田乾"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loneliness_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/static/m_avg/m_avg_loneliness_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":9},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"咳，咳咳……呜……嘶……","id":10},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"虽然……咳咳……但我不喜欢……窒息这个死法……咳咳……","id":11},{"type":"dialog","id":12},{"type":"charslot","id":13},{"type":"dialog","id":14},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_darkmagic","volume":"1","id":15},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_tearspace","delay":"1","id":16},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":17},{"type":"text","text":"结城理看得很清楚，怪物尚未彻底消散，抛出裘里奥之后，它融化在了阴影中。","id":18},{"type":"text","text":"满月般的巨大异变光环依然悬在空中，裘里奥跪在地上痛苦地咳呛，摸索着……","id":19},{"type":"text","text":"埃癸斯快步上前，踢开了裘里奥手边的铳。","id":20},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#8$3","focus":"m","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"裘里奥，不要这样做。","id":22},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"阻止我……有意义吗……咳……你们没办法……一直救我的……","id":24},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#1$3","focus":"m","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"你不会一直想要这样做的。","id":26},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"……为什么……会这么想？难道拉特兰……还能回到以前吗？","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"我确实应该……和父亲一起走的……但是我……胆怯了……","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"我竟然……不知道他当时……咳……是什么心情……","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"我害怕了……","id":31},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"以后……永远……都会这样……这里的每个人……都会这样……","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"为什么……不让我……结束……？","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"结局……已经不会改变了……","id":35},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4218_aigis_1#3$2","focus":"m","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃癸斯","text":"……","id":37},{"type":"dialog","id":38},{"type":"charslot","id":39},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":40},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#4$1","focus":"m","duration":"2","id":41},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":42},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"……如果是这样，那我是不是早就应该去死了？不止是我，所有的黎博利，所有萨科塔以外的人。","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"我真想对你这么说——","id":45},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"……但这里的痛苦已经够多了。","id":47},{"type":"dialog","id":48},{"type":"charslot","id":49},{"type":"text","text":"吉阿达蹬掉鞋子，坐在了地上，坐在跪着的裘里奥身边。","id":50},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":51},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"你想靠着我吗？","id":53},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"……吉阿达，咳咳……你也要救我吗？","id":55},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"我救不了谁，我没那么了不起。","id":57},{"type":"dialog","id":58},{"type":"charslot","id":59},{"type":"text","text":"吉阿达的声音冷淡，手却轻拍着萨科塔的后背，帮他平复气息。","id":60},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":61},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"孩子们刚才把你从怪物手里抢过来，我远远看着都很害怕。我坐下来可不是为了你，是因为腿吓软了。","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"但葬礼还没有结束，陪你休息一会儿之后，你还要和我一起回到葬礼上。你安排的那些东西，你要负责任。","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"就算要先送走客人，送走客人之后，我们也还有工作要完成。","id":65},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"……你是在催自杀的人回去工作吗？","id":67},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"别笑了。我说，你平时就该少笑一点。","id":69},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":70},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"你不想看见我笑，还要救我，还要让我回到你精心筹备的葬礼上吗？明明我都把葬礼搞成这样了……","id":71},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"我也觉得你很离谱。不过现在，我稍微明白你的意思了。","id":73},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"我之前觉得，你只不过是抱着“传统”不肯放手，自以为是，对现实视而不见……","id":75},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#13$1","focus":"r","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"……我不是吗？","id":77},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"如果你真的对现实视而不见，怎么会痛苦。","id":79},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"你只是想要改变它，那我们就是一样的。","id":81},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"……","id":83},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"你知道在我心中，仪式是什么吗？","id":85},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"仪式是语言，是一种“传达”，把难以表述的东西“翻译”成可以看见、触摸、体会、践行的事。","id":87},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"只要是传达，就会有缺憾。萨科塔的仪式曾经是完美的，因为你们其实不需要“翻译”，仪式只是心领神会之后的舞蹈。","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"所以之前我讨厌你设计的葬礼，刻板地跳着过去的舞没有意义，只有可悲和可笑。","id":90},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"如果仪式是“传达”，那么它首要的美德就是诚实。","id":92},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"那现在……你不觉得我在撒谎了？","id":94},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"因为你并没有。你真心实意地……想要在葬礼上传达快乐。","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"不是因为顽固地无视悲伤和遗憾，只是因为你很怀念过去……想留下那样的感情。","id":97},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"我不知道……对萨科塔来说，拉特兰曾经是一种每时每刻都将你们包裹在其中的感情吗……？","id":99},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"我也不知道……或者是忘了。也许我曾经体会过，但我好像很不适合那样生活……父亲带我离开了。","id":101},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"……你只是想留在你想象中的、过去的拉特兰吗？","id":103},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#12$1","focus":"r","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"……你这么说的话，好像确实是这样了……","id":105},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"啊啊……好困难啊。吉阿达。","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"你看，我以为设计仪式是我擅长的事了，可是我做得多糟糕。","id":108},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#13$1","focus":"r","id":109},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"你说仪式是“传达”，可我设计了这么多环节和内容，都没能“传达”给你，最后还是用铳打自己的头，你才相信我。","id":110},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"只要是传达，就会有缺憾，刚才就告诉你了。","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"我们本来就只能尝试着去说，去摸索别人和自己的想法，试探着对话，做出不确定的判断。萨科塔之外的人，一直都是这样活着的。","id":113},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"就算只有这么愚钝又脆弱的心，人也……并非不能感受别人、理解别人。","id":115},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"理解只是需要支付代价。尝试的努力、犯错的风险、失败的悔恨、把自尊作为赌注……","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"输得精光确实是一件可怕的事，有时我也想要吝啬一点……","id":118},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"……这我倒是发现了。","id":120},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"你才没资格说我，发现东西不再免费供应了就害怕到想要逃走的蠢货！","id":122},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#12$1","focus":"r","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"好吧，需要骂得这么难听吗……","id":124},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"也许我还会失败的，我以前就做得很糟糕，以后也许会更糟糕。也许我永远都会失败，直到尽头还是失败。","id":126},{"type":"charslot","id":127},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#8$3","focus":"m","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"别这么肯定，裘里奥。那不是放弃的理由。","id":129},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"理啊，你很固执呢。","id":131},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"和我不一样，你是真的相信你一定能做到，对吧？","id":133},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4217_makoto_1#1$3","focus":"m","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"结城理","text":"也不是。我只是不想放弃。","id":135},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"裘里奥","text":"……真是让人担心的小孩。","id":137},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"结城可不需要你来担心，他比你可靠多了。","id":139},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"你休息够了吧？该和我一起回到葬礼上去了，是真的还有很多事要做。","id":141},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2378_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吉阿达","text":"生活是不会结束的……这是它的优点，或者缺点，你只好接受它。","id":143},{"type":"dialog","id":144},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":145},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":146},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2379_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":147},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":148},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":149},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_darkmagic","volume":"1","id":150},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_tearspace","delay":"1","id":151},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"4","id":152},{"type":"delay","time":"5","id":153},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2387_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":154},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_sys_act16side_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act16side/m_sys_act16side_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":155,"musicid":1},{"type":"dialogue","name":"山岸风花","text":"……啊，异变的景象，消散了！","id":156},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4219_yukari_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岳羽由加莉","text":"所以，我们消灭那个怪物了吗？","id":158},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2388_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"天田乾","text":"嗯……如果一切如博士所推测，那它的本质应该是不可能完全消灭的……","id":160},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4218_aigis_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"埃癸斯","text":"但是，我们确实击败了那个怪物，这点我可以确定。","id":162},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4219_yukari_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":163},{"type":"dialogue","name":"岳羽由加莉","text":"对呀，连那种诡异的景象都消失了嘛……","id":164},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2387_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"山岸风花","text":"……啊！","id":166},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2388_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"天田乾","text":"风花姐，怎么了？！","id":168},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2387_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"山岸风花","text":"那种杂音……","id":170},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2387_1#2$2","focus":"m","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"山岸风花","text":"一直以来干扰着我感知的杂音，也开始减弱了！","id":172},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2387_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"山岸风花","text":"我好像能稍微感知到大家的气息了……","id":174},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2387_1#2$2","focus":"m","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"山岸风花","text":"等杂音再减弱一些，也许……就能感知到门扉的位置了！","id":176},{"type":"dialog","id":177},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":178},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":179},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":180},{"type":"charslot","id":181},{"type":"background","id":182},{"type":"image","id":183}],"characters":["裘里奥","结城理","埃癸斯","吉阿达","山岸风花","岳羽由加莉","天田乾"]}